WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.423
[MUSIC PLAYING AND CROWD
 CHEERING]

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:11.956
 We're joined by the god
of thunder, Chris Hemsworth!

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:12.850
 Thank you very much.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.550
 It's really fun to get to
be a 6 foot character when

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.280
you're a 5' 3" girl, you know?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.160
That doesn't happen
often in your life.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.210
 His name is
self-explanatory, isn't it?

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.327
 It's exciting and humbling.

00:00:26.327 --> 00:00:27.460
And I don't know
if they're trying

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.780
to usher me out
to the finish line

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.290
quickly and get on with it.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.820
But either way, I'll take it.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.370
 It's been a lot of bloody fun.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.420
 I think everyone was
really having a good time.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.900
And you can tell when you
watch it, like it's a party.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.310
WOMAN: Valkyrie!

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:40.570
Valkyrie!

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.450
 No, she's just a big
pile of mush, you know?

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:47.380
 I think Taika wanted to make
a romantic comedy set in space

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.150
and it's that.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.340
 I've spent years in
space now at this point,

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.590
so it's becoming
really normal to be.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:54.640
[LAUGHS]

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.690
 She's into the suits.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.630
She loves musical theater.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:00.740
 Well, well, well,
what's happening, team?

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:01.540
We all right?

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.330
Let's give a shout out to all
these wonderful cosplayers

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.170
out here, man.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:05.970
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:06.840
I love it.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.640
 Taika Waititi.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:08.630
Hello, sir.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.087
[CROWD CHANTING]

00:01:10.087 --> 00:01:11.120
 I didn't ask them to do this.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:11.920
 OK.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.217
 This genre is the Taika genre.

00:01:14.217 --> 00:01:15.950
 I've got to ask you a
little bit more about Taika.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.750
Is he like a big brother?

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:18.930
Is he like a funny uncle?

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:19.730
Is he a tyrant?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.380
What's he like on set?

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.650
 A bit of all three, I guess.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:23.450
 I love it.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.910
There's zero pressure
on me and there's

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.380
all the pressure on Taika.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.370
 Taika is just amazing.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.850
He's a force of nature.

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.850
 [MIMICKING NEW ZEALAND ACCENT]
I've re-written the script,

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.760
mate, and you know,
I decided to put

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.800
some goats in there and see
what he's going to do with them.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.570
 I'm really amazed
with all the actors I

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:39.950
managed to get into this film.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:42.650
 You know, we had to
plan the whole dance

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.950
that Taika and I had planned.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.680
We didn't get to shoot it again.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.940
That will be for another film.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.280
But a whole Gorr dance.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.870
 You know, sometimes
with villains

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.010
you just need them to be
bad and not amazing dancers.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.710
 I'm pretty sure
if I say anything,

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:59.610
a Marvel sniper will get me.

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.490
 I can tell you nothing.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.050
I can tell you Thor is in it.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:04.280
 But you know how Marvel is.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.030
They won't even let us
know what's going on.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.670
And so I'm about to
go in this theater

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.410
and find out what
the hell we did.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.720
 How does it feel to know
that people are talking more

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:15.260
about your biceps than his?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.130
 Well, I mean--

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.030
 It was all my doing.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.220
I wouldn't ask her that.
No, no.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:20.630
No, let's just keep
that between us.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.430
 OK.

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.780
 Hats off to anyone who has
to deal with acrylic nails.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.010
I couldn't do anything.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.210
 Am I a fully fledged Guardian?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.010
WOMAN: Yes.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.600
 Yes, I think I am.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:30.710
 The nice-- oop.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.120
That's OK.
- My apologies.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.110
 No, you're all good.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:36.650
Christian Bale, you can bump
into me any time you want to.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:40.308
 Gorr and the Mighty
Thor in Thor four.

00:02:40.308 --> 00:02:41.510
- More!
- More.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.440
Yeah, there is is.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:43.400
 The fans can tell me.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.900
Why is Valkyrie important?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.610
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.280
She's a bad ass.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.170
Yeah.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.620
 I hope everybody
loves the movie.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:51.420
Thanks for having me.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:52.240
This is the best.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.370
 I'm so happy to be back.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.430
I feel so lucky to be
back with this crew.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.360
 Made this movie for you.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.060
You're the best fan
base in the world.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.950
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.200
We love you.
We love you.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.000
Thank you.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.480
 It's just been unlike
anything else I've done.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:09.830
[MUSIC PLAYING]

